**Mathematical Phase 4 goal:**

$$C(T_{Phase4}) = K \cdot E \cdot \mathbf{I}_{weighted} \gg C(2025) \quad \text{by a factor of} \geq 10^6$$

$$K_{index}(T_{Phase4}) \approx 1.0$$

This represents the mathematical endpoint of the strategic roadmap: a civilization whose productive capability has scaled by six or more orders of magnitude above its 2025 baseline, operating across the inner solar system, with human employment sustained by a frontier whose complexity compounds faster than AI can automate it.

